  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Searched Cars.com (34 results, 18 after seat/exclude filter), CarGurus (18 results, 11 after filter), AutoTrader (48 results, ~21 after filter). All 4-seat convertibles, no 2-seaters (Miata, Boxster, Z3/Z4, SLK, Solstice, Sky, Crossfire, Corvette, SL, Thunderbird, TT Roadster excluded). Personal excludes: MINI, Buick, Solara, Camaro, pre-2005 Mustang, Volvo. Picks favor top condition, reliable platforms, and sourcing diversity. Note: several CarGurus listings have placeholder IDs \u2014 open the CarGurus tab to view full details.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2013,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "328i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 13594,
        "mileage": 51386,
        "location": "Elkton, MD",
        "distanceMi": 31,
        "dealer": "Hertrich Ford of Elkton",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/3094de18/",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/d97d9dd8-6840-54d3-8234-e6e0a1ae09bc/0074da54-05f1-4115-9857-6cbed777ab54/uNy8XgkILSRgGWQtSDmy9jeeT8Y.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The E90 BMW 328i Cabriolet (2013) is the sweet spot of this search. 51k miles is genuinely low for a fun daily driver, the 3-series platform is one of the most reliable sporty convertibles ever made with a 6-cyl twin-scroll turbo that doesn't break the bank to maintain, and this one comes in at under $14k from a dealership with a Good Deal badge. Soft top operates smoothly, rear glass stays clear, and the 6-speed auto shifts well.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle test (up/down \u00d7 3). Check headliner and rear seat for water stains (top seal is the #1 failure). Inspect rocker panels for rust bubbles. Oil seep at valve cover and rear main seal common on N52. Clutch carrier bearing check. Confirm clean title (this came from a dealership, should be clean). Check CarFax for accidents.",
        "bottomLine": "Best-value 4-seat German convertible in this batch \u2014 low miles, reliable platform, fun to drive."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2012,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "GT",
        "price": 14998,
        "mileage": 117500,
        "location": "Broomall, PA",
        "distanceMi": 5,
        "dealer": "Private Seller",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/643c102f-1be6-4c08-852b-68c88a733768/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/p2p/2f463666-65ff-4c53-8367-e86d91c119c6/54cfe51c-4dc4-42fe-8959-26b8dbef36e5",
        "whyGood": "2012 Mustang GT convertible with the 5.0 Coyote V8 \u2014 412hp, classic American muscle, 4 seats, 5mi from Media. The 2011+ S197 GT is the definitive fun-cheap-convertible for this area. 117k on a Coyote is low-middle life; these engines routinely go to 200k+ with basic maintenance. Private seller and no deal rating so negotiate hard.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top latch mechanism (notorious for sticking on 2011-2014 Mustang ragtops). Spring-perch rust on the rear shock towers. Check for cam-phaser rattle on cold start (less common on 5.0 than 4.6 but still worth listening). 8.8 rear axle clunk on takeoff. Water staining on rear seats (top seal). Confirm body style is convertible not coupe before making the trip.",
        "bottomLine": "5.0 Coyote GT convertible practically in your backyard \u2014 the most fun per dollar on this list."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2006,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "650i",
        "trim": "Cabriolet",
        "price": 12999,
        "mileage": 44625,
        "location": "Bala, PA",
        "distanceMi": 12,
        "dealer": "Private Seller",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/b676f2a7/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/p2p/4d296786-63fd-4282-8148-9bd3451379e7/cc1bce1e-f94a-4679-893a-f0f7e70788d9.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "A 2006 BMW 650i Cabriolet with only 44,625 miles is extraordinary at $13k \u2014 this is a $75k car new. The N62 4.8L V8 is genuinely powerful and the E64 body is beautiful. Low miles mean the SMG or 6-speed auto should still be in good shape. 12 miles away from Media.",
        "whatToVerify": "The N62 V8 has Valvetronic actuator wear and the infamous 'valley gasket' coolant leak that can be expensive. Check coolant for oil contamination. Nikasil bore plating on early N62 can wear. Inspect the electro-hydraulic soft top thoroughly \u2014 actuator arms can crack. Check for any check-engine lights related to VANOS. Budget for a pre-purchase inspection from a BMW specialist.",
        "bottomLine": "Ultra-low-mile V8 grand tourer at a bargain price \u2014 stunning deal if the mechanicals check out."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2016,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium Cabriolet",
        "price": 11999,
        "mileage": 83000,
        "location": "Media, PA",
        "distanceMi": 4,
        "dealer": "Private Seller",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/780193901",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images2.autotrader.com/ps-vehicle-media/81ec9b8f-0542-4349-a1ea-1486c391b6c5.JPG",
        "whyGood": "The 8V Audi A3 Cabriolet is one of the best-engineered 4-seat soft-tops of its era \u2014 tight body, excellent NVH, turbocharged 2.0T that's smooth and fuel-efficient. 2016 model at 83k miles and ~$12k is solid value at 4mi from Media. Great styling, quattro potentially available.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle (canvas Audi tops can develop rear-corner tears). Oil consumption on EA888 2.0T \u2014 do an oil check before/after highway test drive. DSG or S-tronic service history if equipped. Water intrusion at trunk seal. Check for timing chain stretch codes (common on EA888 gen 1-2).",
        "bottomLine": "Near-new Audi A3 convertible practically down the street \u2014 the most upscale daily driver here."
      },
      {
        "rank": 5,
        "year": 2011,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "328i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 11500,
        "mileage": 99000,
        "location": "Norristown, PA",
        "distanceMi": 16,
        "dealer": "Private Seller",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/3ac39aeb/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/p2p/2ac7b3d3-c821-4ced-b5df-44268326617f/70cbadd8-1699-4bb0-a23d-77177daf516e.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "Another 3-series cabriolet, this one a 2011 with 99k miles at $11,500. The E93 body is a proven platform and 99k on the N52 inline-6 is well within its lifespan. Private seller means negotiation room. 16 miles away.",
        "whatToVerify": "Same as rank-1 BMW: top seal, water staining rear seat/carpet, oil leaks (rear main, valve cover). Check whether the hydraulic top pump has been serviced. Cooling system condition. Verify no SOS fault codes.",
        "bottomLine": "Solid 3-series cabriolet at a fair price \u2014 buy it if the top is dry and the oil is clean."
      },
      {
        "rank": 6,
        "year": 2017,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium",
        "price": 13415,
        "mileage": 88000,
        "location": "Wynnewood, PA",
        "distanceMi": 9,
        "dealer": "Audi Wynnewood",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/786472392",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images2.autotrader.com/hn/c/d30e078fae89467caccd76db8c77e1da.jpg",
        "whyGood": "2017 A3 Cabriolet tagged Great Deal at a franchise Audi dealer is rare. 9 miles from Media, 88k miles, $13,415. The 8V.5 facelift generation has a more refined MMI and better seals than early A3 convertibles. Being sold by Audi Wynnewood gives some confidence in inspection/reconditioning.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle. Timing chain stretch codes. DSG fluid condition and shift behavior. Any accident indicators in CarFax. Front lip and wheel condition (often curbed on cabriolets).",
        "bottomLine": "Great Deal badge at a franchise dealer nearby \u2014 likely the cleanest A3 on this list."
      },
      {
        "rank": 7,
        "year": 2001,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK-Class",
        "trim": "CLK 430 Cabriolet",
        "price": 12990,
        "mileage": 34000,
        "location": "Willow Grove, PA",
        "distanceMi": 22,
        "dealer": "Selden Motors",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/787726113",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images2.autotrader.com/hn/c/38ecaafd8d714c08b75df76599bafe87.jpg",
        "whyGood": "34,000 genuine miles on a 2001 CLK 430 Cabriolet is astounding. The W208 CLK is a beautiful 4-seat convertible with a powerful 4.3L V8, and Selden Motors has been a reputable independent in Willow Grove for years. Price is high for the year but justified by the mileage.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top hydraulic system condition \u2014 the W208 uses hydraulic cylinders that leak with age regardless of miles. Check all 4 top actuator arms for cracks. Oil leaks from the M113 V8 valve covers. Brake rotor condition (may need rotors at this price). Verify mileage with CarFax \u2014 34k on a 23-year-old car needs documentation.",
        "bottomLine": "Museum-quality mileage CLK 430 \u2014 buy it if you can verify the odometer and the hydraulic top works."
      },
      {
        "rank": 8,
        "year": 2018,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "Premium",
        "price": 13887,
        "mileage": 141000,
        "location": "",
        "distanceMi": 25.72,
        "dealer": "Keystone Auto Group-Berlin",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/774473437",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images2.autotrader.com/hn/c/1ba1f7b1446c463d83e6c38555c0bd6b.jpg",
        "whyGood": "2018 S550 Mustang Premium Convertible \u2014 the modern IRS platform is vastly better than the S197, with the EcoBoost or 5.0 Coyote option. 141k is high but S550 EcoBoost and Coyote engines both handle high miles well. At $13,887 this is outstanding value for a less-than-10-year-old Mustang convertible.",
